## Exception: third-party diagram sources and images

The ground-truth PlantUML sources in `data/puml_files/` are **not original work
of this project**. They were mined from public open-source repositories through
World of Code, and each file remains under the licence of the repository it came
from. Those licences vary and are not restated here.

The same applies to any image rendered from those sources, including the
standardized model-input images distributed through the Zenodo deposition. A
render is a derivative of its source file and carries the source file's licence,
not CC BY 4.0.

The CC BY 4.0 grant above therefore covers this project's own contributions:
the selection and stratification of the 1,000-diagram benchmark set, the key
list and its metadata (`data/test_set.json`), the model predictions in
`data/runs/`, the computed metric results, the generated exhibits, and the
written documentation. It does not and cannot relicense the upstream diagram
sources or their renders.

Anyone redistributing or building on the diagram sources or their renders is
responsible for observing the licence of each originating repository.

## Model predictions

The files under `data/runs/` are outputs generated by third-party models. They
are distributed here as research evidence. Use of model outputs may also be
subject to the terms of the provider that generated them.

